      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know u keep saying the doctor thing but isnt the main risk just like, diarrhea or something? like, if i take the 1000mg and it just makes me have to run to the bathroom, thats not really dangerous, right? i'm just trying to figure out if i can just do this for like 3 days to get my sleep back. if i stay hydrated it should flush everything out anyway, shouldn't it? just tell me if a high dose for a few days is actually gonna break my kidneys or if ur just being extra cautious.",
